---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="CTF" description="CTF competition achievements and results by Jst3r">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container ctf-page">
      <h1 class="section-title">CTF Achievements</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Competition results and rankings</p>

      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">#10</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Moroccan CTFtime Ranking</span>
          <span class="stat-detail">Solo player, single CTF</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">#9</span>
          <span class="stat-label">IDEH CTF</span>
          <span class="stat-detail">National competition</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number">#9</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Cyber Odyssey Finals</span>
          <span class="stat-detail">National finals</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ctf-section">
        <h2>Competition History</h2>
        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <h3>Cyber Odyssey Finals</h3>
                <span class="tag tag--cyan">9th Place</span>
              </div>
              <p>Competed in the national Cyber Odyssey finals. Solved challenges in RE and web categories.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <h3>IDEH CTF</h3>
                <span class="tag tag--purple">9th Place</span>
              </div>
              <p>National cybersecurity competition. Strong performance across reverse engineering and web challenges.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <h3>CTFtime Morocco</h3>
                <span class="tag tag--green">Top 10</span>
              </div>
              <p>Ranked 10th on the Moroccan CTFtime leaderboard playing solo in a single competition — demonstrating strong individual skills across multiple categories.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ctf-section">
        <h2>Favorite Categories</h2>
        <div class="categories-grid">
          <div class="category-card">
            <div class="category-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Reverse Engineering</h3>
            <p>Binary analysis, decompilation, and understanding obfuscation techniques.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="category-card">
            <div class="category-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Web</h3>
            <p>SQL injection, XSS, SSRF, authentication bypasses, and modern web vulnerabilities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .ctf-page {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  /* Stats */
  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .stat-card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stat-detail {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  /* Sections */
  .ctf-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .ctf-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* Timeline */
  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .timeline-item:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .timeline-dot {
    position: absolute;
    left: -2rem;
    top: 0.375rem;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-4px);
  }

  .timeline-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-header h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .timeline-content p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Categories */
  .categories-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .category-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }

  .category-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
  }

  .category-icon {
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .category-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .category-card p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .categories-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
